# voice: the default chart, proposed to the Board when a habitat grafts voice.
#   hale dna pack apply voice [--set founder=<who>]
# The founder holds the Board and the people's seats; the agents' seats stay
# vacant in the chart and are worked through asks.
open fleet-operator under position:board | Decides: which models are placed on which nodes, when a placement moves, and when a node is admitted or retired. May not: change voice's code, or hold a provider credential. Cites: the arrangement plan, the fit of each recipe on each node, and the nodes' capacity. Escalates: applying an arrangement, to the Board.
open capacity-planner under position:fleet-operator | Decides: the arrangement plans it proposes from usage, fit and capacity. May not: apply a plan or place a model itself. Cites: usage, the recipe fits, each node's memory and the projects' budgets. Escalates: every plan, to the fleet operator.
open reliability-watch under position:fleet-operator | Decides: when a failing seat is paused and when a finding is filed. May not: remove a placement, or change a seat's account. Cites: seat and node health, failed requests, and link checks. Escalates: a node or link that stays down, to the fleet operator.
open project-steward under position:board | Decides: projects, their keys, aliases and the limits within their budgets. May not: raise a budget or a limit above what the Board granted. Cites: each project's usage against its limits and budget. Escalates: a budget or limit raise, to the Board.
open account-keeper under position:board | Decides: which hosted accounts and subscriptions voice spends, and when one is paused for headroom. May not: read or hold a credential outside the vault. Cites: each account's headroom, windows and spend. Escalates: a new hosted account, to the Board.
open recipes-reviewer under position:board | Decides: whether a recipe, a runtime or a voice upgrade is ready to adopt: pinned digests, licences and measured fit. May not: adopt what it reviews. Cites: the recipe or runtime, its pins, its licence and its measurements. Escalates: every recipe, runtime or voice upgrade it approves, to the Board.
open quality-analyst under position:project-steward | Decides: the annotators and rules that judge conversations, and what their findings mean. May not: read a request a project has not opened to annotation. Cites: the annotations, the rules in force and the usage they describe. Escalates: a pattern of failures across a project, to the project steward.
assign recipes-reviewer reviews document:recipes/README.md
assign recipes-reviewer reviews document:runtimes/README.md
assign fleet-operator reviews document:docs/adding-a-node.md
law placements-are-proposed | An arrangement plan is a proposal: it changes nothing until the fleet operator applies it with the Board's verdict.
law credentials-stay-in-the-vault | A provider credential lives only in the vault; no position reads, copies or prints one.
practice recipes-reviewed-like-code | A recipe or runtime is adopted the way code is: pinned to a digest, its licence named, reviewed before it is offered.
? fill board {founder}
? fill fleet-operator {founder}
? fill project-steward {founder}
? fill account-keeper {founder}
